// RUN: llzk-opt %S/../SymbolicEvaluation/direct-array-pipeline_pass.llzk --llzk-monomorphize --llzk-evaluate-constraints --llzk-full-direct-r1cs-lowering | FileCheck %s
// The two nested array elements get distinct private wires after public inputs.

// NOTE: Assertions have been autogenerated by scripts/generate-test-checks.py

